sequenceDiagram
    actor User
    participant FE as 🌐 Frontend
    participant API as ⚙️ FastAPI
    participant AI as 🧠 LLM Service
    participant DB as 🗄️ Vector DB
    participant LOG as 📊 MLflow

    User->>FE: Search jobs
    FE->>API: API request
    API->>AI: Create embeddings
    AI-->>API: Vector
    API->>DB: Similarity search
    DB-->>API: Results
    API->>LOG: Log metrics
    API-->>FE: Response
    FE-->>User: Show results